s of the script leads to their values receiving the notification.\r\n> \r\n> For core types this would not be an issue. But if the ref counted value has a script written in GDScript it couldn't run code anymore, later in the clean-up.\r\n\r\nHrm, thinking about it, this is the [SIOF](https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/language/siof) all over again 😅\r\nAm i right in assuming that, by the time GDScript destructs, the game's tree has already destructed? Because that would be my main worry; we can't really solve SIOF with this PR and you probably won't make it any worse anyhow.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892436201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892570771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976#issuecomment-4892570771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","id":4892570771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI560kw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T12:06:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:06:08Z","body":"Wait, are you thinking about C++ static variables? I'm talking about the GDScript ones:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass Test:\r\n    func _notification(what):\r\n        if what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\r\n            print(\"Shutting down\")\r\n\r\nstatic var test := Test.new()\r\n\r\n# On exit \"Shutting down\" must be printed.\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhile GDScript certainly has SIOF among it's own static vars, the GDScriptLanguage shutdown does run well-defined before C++ SIOF starts.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892570771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892583575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976#issuecomment-4892583575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","id":4892583575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI57mlw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T12:07:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:07:59Z","body":"No, I'm talking about GDScript, not C++ - but I assume the initialization / destruction order is similarly not well-defined internally (?)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892583575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892728624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976#issuecomment-4892728624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","id":4892728624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI6EdMA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T12:23:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:23:27Z","body":"It's not as far as I'm aware. Prior to this PR it depended on how scripts are referenced (with potential crashes when referenced beyond `GDScriptLanguage`s lifetime). With this PR it's based on the order in which the scripts were loaded, but I consider that an implementation detail. So to me it's a non-issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4892728624/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950888817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976#issuecomment-4950888817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","id":4950888817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJxiRcQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T10:44:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T10:45:07Z","body":"> Final comment: `clearing` is also toggled in `gdscript_compiler.cpp:2701–2750`. If that code triggers during destruction, that might create problems with the `SelfList`. Might be worth adding a check for, either there, or by loosening the guard not to clear while `clearing=true` (which I asked about above).\r\n\r\nI was thinking about this, and kinda decided to ignore it as part of: loading a GDScript during shutdown is probably broken but that's an issue for another day.\r\n\r\nI think if we want to do something about it we should stick with a check in `gdscript_compiler.cpp` that prints an error to make the user aware.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950888817/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959800892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976#issuecomment-4959800892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","id":4959800892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6COPA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github